DEFINE POPUP shortcut SHORTCUT RELATIVE FROM MROW(),MCOL()
DEFINE BAR 1 OF shortcut PROMPT "RR - TOLL PACKERS"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF shortcut PROMPT "RR - SUPPLIERS"
ON SELECTION BAR 1 OF shortcut mrropt = 1
ON SELECTION BAR 2 OF shortcut mrropt = 2

ACTIVATE POPUP shortcut